###

### HU-FASE2-086 — Reactivar nota
PATCH {{base}}/{{notaId}}/activate
Authorization: {{token}}

###

### HU-FASE2-086 — Eliminación lógica (solo si NO está firmada)
DELETE {{base}}/{{notaId}}
Authorization: {{token}}

